// PPO hyperparameters for the FINAL fine-tune stage that produced
// models/heading_hold/hh_s3g_verylowlr_bigbatch.mpk — see heading_hold_tight_tracking.reward.ron
// for the full recipe and the earlier stages this continues from. NOT the task default; pass
// explicitly via --ppo-config. entropy_coef MUST be 0.0: the task default (0.005, tuned for
// training a heading policy from random init) actively destabilizes PPO once the policy is
// already BC-pretrained/converged — a 2026-08-05 diagnostic batch found entropy grew
// unboundedly and value_loss oscillated wildly under entropy_coef=0.005 + the current
// terminal_failure_penalty scale, while entropy_coef=0.0 (mirroring level_hold.ppo.ron)
// converged cleanly in the same run. lr=3e-5 (10x below the task default 3e-4) and
// rollout_steps=4096 (2x the default 2048, for a lower-variance value target) are what closed
// the final altitude-tracking gap after several coarser passes plateaued around 1.3-2m.
(
    gamma: 0.99,
    gae_lambda: 0.95,
    clip_epsilon: 0.1,
    value_coef: 0.5,
    entropy_coef: 0.0,
    lr: 0.00003,
    rollout_steps: 4096,
    n_epochs: 4,
    minibatch: 64,
    seed: Some(44),
)
